    {
      "block_id": "h3-14",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "3A. Stage Numbering Conflicts (Critical)",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-15",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "The **implementation-roadmap.md** has non-sequential ordering:",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "code-16",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "text",
      "content": "Line  3: Stage 0\nLine 25: Stage 1\nLine 75: Stage 2\nLine 114: Stage 3\nLine 190: Stage 5 ← Stage 5 BEFORE Stage 4\nLine 236: Stage 4 ← Stage 4 AFTER Stage 5\nLine 301: Stage 5 (duplicate — Worktree / Lane Awareness)\nLine 326: Stage 5 (duplicate — Aggregate Patch Eligibility)\nLine 350: Stage 6\nLine 373: Stage 7",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "detailed",
        "collapsible": true,
        "collapsed_by_default": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-17",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Three entries claim \"Stage 5\". The ordering suggests parsed summaries should be Stage 4 and worktree/lane awareness should be Stage 5, but the entries are reversed.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-18",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "The **validate-tool-contract.md** also has out-of-order sections: - Stage 2, Stage 3, Stage 5, then Stage 4",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-19",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "**Recommendation:** Adopt canonical numbering: - Stage 0: Audit and Contract Only - Stage 1: Read-Only Validate Profiles - Stage 2: Content-Light ValidateReceipt - Stage 3: Path-Scoped Validation Profiles - Stage 4: Parsed Summaries - Stage 5: Worktree/Lane Awareness and Dirty-State Policy - Stage 6: Aggregate Patch Eligibility - Stage 7: Promotion Gate Integration - Stage 8: Fleet/Delegate Policy Integration",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h3-20",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "3B. Schema Drift (Medium)",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-21",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- **Result schema:** `before_git_state` and `after_git_state` are defined as `type: object` with no properties, described as \"Optional pre-state git snapshot\". The Pydantic model `ValidateGitState` has 18 specific fields. The schema should either define these properties or reference a `$defs/ValidateGitState`. - **Receipt schema:** Has proper `GitSummary` `$def` that matches the model — no drift here. - **Invocation schema:** Matches Pydantic model exactly.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h3-22",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
